classDiagram
    direction LR

    class PawPalUI {
        <<app.py module>>
        +List~Owner~ owners session state
        +Owner selectedOwner
    }

    class Owner {
        +String name
        +List~String~ preferences
        +List~Pet~ pets
        +addPet(pet)
        +getAllTasks(petName, status, asOfDate) List~PetTask~
    }

    class Pet {
        +String name
        +String species
        +List~Task~ tasks
        +addTask(task)
        +completeTask(task, completedOn) Optional~Task~
        +getTasks() List~Task~
    }

    class Task {
        +String title
        +int durationMinutes
        +String priority
        +String frequency
        +Time dueTime
        +bool isComplete
        +Date startsOn
        +Date completedOn
        +markComplete(completedOn)
    }

    class PetTask {
        <<temporary association>>
        +Pet pet
        +Task task
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +sortByTime(tasks) List~Task~
        +filterTasks(petTasks, petName, status, asOfDate) List~PetTask~
        +buildDailyPlan(owner, availableMinutes, dayStart, petName, status, scheduleDate) SchedulePlan
        +organizeTasks(petTasks, availableMinutes, dayStart, preferences, petName, status, scheduleDate) SchedulePlan
        +detectConflicts(scheduledTasks) List~String~
        +explainPlan(plan) String
    }

    class SchedulePlan {
        +List~ScheduledTask~ scheduled
        +List~SkippedTask~ skipped
        +int availableMinutes
        +Time dayStart
    }

    class ScheduledTask {
        +Pet pet
        +Task task
        +Time startTime
    }

    class SkippedTask {
        +Pet pet
        +Task task
        +String reason
    }

    PawPalUI ..> Owner : creates and selects from session state
    PawPalUI ..> Pet : creates for selected owner
    PawPalUI ..> Task : creates and completes
    PawPalUI ..> Scheduler : filters, sorts, plans, checks conflicts
    Owner "1" *-- "0..*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" *-- "0..*" Task : stores occurrences
    Owner ..> PetTask : getAllTasks returns pairs
    PetTask --> Pet
    PetTask --> Task
    Scheduler ..> Owner : requests all tasks and preferences
    Scheduler ..> PetTask : filters and organizes task-pet pairs
    Scheduler ..> SchedulePlan : builds
    SchedulePlan "1" *-- "0..*" ScheduledTask : scheduled entries
    SchedulePlan "1" *-- "0..*" SkippedTask : skipped with reason
    ScheduledTask --> Pet
    ScheduledTask --> Task
    SkippedTask --> Pet
    SkippedTask --> Task
    Scheduler ..> ScheduledTask : checks overlapping intervals
    Scheduler ..> SkippedTask : records exclusions and scheduling limits

    note for PawPalUI "The Streamlit module creates owners, requires an owner selection when adding a pet, and scopes task management and schedules to the selected owner."
    note for Pet "Completing a recurring occurrence stores it as complete and adds a new Task for its next occurrence."
    note for Scheduler "Conflict checks return warning strings and are separate from the sequential daily-plan builder."